 sure to not the pore size and percent open. This will likely require a dif=
ferent holder but could be just adhered across the face of the empty holder=
.=C2=A0<u></u><u></u></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:black"><u></u>=C2=A0<u></u></sp=
an></p>
